# Worker runtime secrets for the SSR preview routes (wrangler dev reads this;
# production uses `wrangler secret put SANITY_TOKEN`).
# A Sanity token with read access to drafts (Viewer is enough).
SANITY_TOKEN=

# Cloudflare API token for the Studio's "Site stats" panel (/api/stats).
# ONE permission: Account · Account Analytics · Read. Read-only, so it can
# change nothing. Production uses `wrangler secret put CF_ANALYTICS_TOKEN`.
# Its partner CF_ACCOUNT_ID is NOT a secret and lives in wrangler.jsonc vars.
# Leave blank and the panel says, in plain language, that it is not set up yet.
CF_ANALYTICS_TOKEN=
